### The claims with their items and categories (run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims?$expand=items($expand=category)

### One request creates a claim and its items; the handler sums the total
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims
Content-Type: application/json

< ./new-claim.json

### An item with a negative amount: rejected with HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims
Content-Type: application/json

< ./bad-claim.json

### A claim without title and items: HTTP 400 with two errors
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims
Content-Type: application/json

< ./empty-claim.json

### The bound action submit: sets the status to S once, then answers HTTP 409
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/claims/Claims(a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)/ClaimsService.submit
Content-Type: application/json

{}
